<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Servizi – La Gaia Custode</title>

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
      background: #faf8f4;
      color: #333;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    nav {
      background: #faf8f4;
      padding: 1rem;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    nav a {
      margin: 0 .7rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #6d7f5f;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: .4rem .8rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
      transition: .2s;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      background: #d9a48f;
      color: white;
    }

    .banner img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 300px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-bottom-left-radius: 40px;
      border-bottom-right-radius: 40px;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: 2rem auto;
      padding: 1rem;
    }

    h1 {
      color: #6d7f5f;
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 1.8rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
      border: 1px solid #eee;
      transition: .3s ease;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }

    .card-icon {
      width: 52px;
      height: 52px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: .6rem;
    }

    .card-icon img {
      width: 30px;
    }

    h3 {
      color: #6d7f5f;
      margin-bottom: .4rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <nav>
    <a href="index.html">Home</a>
    <a href="chi-sono.html">Chi sono</a>
    <a href="servizi.html">Servizi</a>
  </nav>

  <section class="banner">
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511895426328-dc8714191300?q=80&w=1200" alt="Banner materno infantile">
  </section>

  <main class="container">
    <h1>Servizi</h1>

    <div class="cards">

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon" style="background:#e8efe6;">
          <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/4320/4320337.png">
        </div>
        <h3>Accompagnamento alla Nascita e nel Post Parto</h3>
        <p>Presenza calma, ascolto e sostegno pratico durante gravidanza, parto e prime settimane.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon" style="background:#f3e3dd;">
          <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2965/2965879.png">
        </div>
        <h3>Allattamento</h3>
        <p>Supporto rispettoso e personalizzato per affrontare difficoltà, dubbi e fatiche.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon" style="background:#e8efe6;">
          <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/4206/4206277.png">
        </div>
        <h3>Babywearing</h3>
        <p>Scelta del supporto, legature sicure e consigli pratici per portare con serenità.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon" style="background:#f3e3dd;">
          <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/3468/3468377.png">
        </div>
        <h3>Sonno Infantile e Familiare</h3>
        <p>Accompagnamento dolce, senza metodi rigidi. Routine serene e soluzioni reali.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon" style="background:#e8efe6;">
          <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/4320/4320361.png">
        </div>
        <h3>Massaggio Infantile</h3>
        <p>Connessione, contatto e benessere attraverso gesti semplici e delicati.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>

</body>
</html>
